ent-DieOfFate = die of fate
    .desc = A die with twenty sides. You can feel unearthly energies radiating from it. Using this might be VERY risky.

die-of-fate-roll-1 = You crumble into ash!
die-of-fate-roll-2 = Your body is torn apart!
die-of-fate-roll-3 = Hostile creatures appear around you!
die-of-fate-roll-4 = All your items crumble into ash!
die-of-fate-roll-5 = You feel a primal urge... OOH OOH AH AH!
die-of-fate-roll-6 = Your legs feel heavy...
die-of-fate-roll-7 = An unseen force hurls you!
die-of-fate-roll-8 = You explode!
die-of-fate-roll-9 = You feel sick...
die-of-fate-roll-10 = Hmm... Nothing happens?..
die-of-fate-roll-11 = You got a cookie!
die-of-fate-roll-12 = A warm light envelops you, healing all your wounds!
die-of-fate-roll-13 = Money rains from the sky!
die-of-fate-roll-14 = A revolver materializes in your hands!
die-of-fate-roll-15 = Arcane knowledge floods your mind!
die-of-fate-roll-16 = A loyal servant appears to serve you!
die-of-fate-roll-17 = A crate of syndicate goods materializes!
die-of-fate-roll-18 = A captain's ID card appears!
die-of-fate-roll-19 = You feel tougher!
die-of-fate-roll-20 = Immense magical power surges through you!

die-of-fate-familiar-name = Familiar
die-of-fate-familiar-role-name = Familiar
die-of-fate-familiar-role-desc = You are a magical familiar summoned to serve {$master}. Follow their orders and protect them at all costs.

die-of-fate-examine-inert = The die of fate has been used too many times and is now inert. It feels cold to the touch.
